# Zirda, the Dawnwaker's "Abilities you activate that aren't mana abilities cost {2} less to activate" leaves a mana ability
# alone, though the cost changes apply to mana abilities (CR 605.3, 602.2b, 601.2f): its own words except them (CR 605.1a).
